Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Couchbase <http://go.couchbase.com/302GJY0340000I9000VXy00> 	 
[Webinar] - Introducing Couchbase Server 2.5:Better Reliability and Security for Enterprises

LIVE WEBINAR: February 26, 2014 at 10am PST
Register now  <http://go.couchbase.com/302GJY0340000Ia000VXy00> 

Curious to know whatâ€™s new in Couchbase Server 2.5? Couchbase Server is a NoSQL document database for interactive apps. The latest 2.5 Couchbase Server release is here and includes several exciting features in areas like reliability, security and connection management. With this release, enterprises can use rack zone awareness and secure cross datacenter for better reliability and security. In this webinar, youâ€™ll also get to see a hands-on tour of the new features in Couchbase Server with a live demo.

*	What is rack-zone awareness in Couchbase Server and how it can be used for increased reliability and availability.
*	How you can use secure cross datacenter replication for enhanced security on-the-wire when data is replicated from one datacenter to another, and
*	How better connection management in Couchbase Server 2.5 can help you support many more clients, thus enabling higher scale.

Register Now <http://go.couchbase.com/302GJY0340000Ia000VXy00> 

 

See you there!

Sincerely,
The Couchbase Team

couchbase.com <http://go.couchbase.com/302GJY0340000I9000VXy00> 	 Free Download <http://go.couchbase.com/302GJY0340000Ib000VXy00> 
